From 11d358e7d6e99c8bade69b3f96e53de930d379a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 13:54:39 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] www: 25 packs - System Log exclusions, Wallguard's reasons,
 the review rules list

32 tokens added in every pack, translated: RLOG_89-101 (Find / Exclude and
saved exclusions), RSHD_133-137 (the DNS-bypass banner and a list Warden
blocks), RFW_396-409 (the review bar and the rules list).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
